    <p>(2)</p>
  
  <p>Write an inequality about the amount of room on her display table.</p>

    <p>(3)</p> 
  
<p>These are the <term>constraints</term>. (And of course,  <m>x \ge 0,~y \ge 0</m>.)</p></li>

<li><p>Graph each inequalilty, one at a time, on the grid.</p>
