<li><p>Do you see that as <m>R</m> increases, the line of <m>x</m> and <m>y</m> values that produce that revenue moves across the set of feasible solutions? If we continue to increase <m>R</m>, what is the last point on that set that it will touch? (Try moving a ruler parallel to the <m>R</m> lines to see the point.)</p></li>

